  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Our very basic SDK2 world uses a standard prefab to display a static twitch stream when you enter the world. It worked flawlessly until the newest VRChat update build 992 where it broke for everyone. \nThe video player isn't displaying the twitch stream anymore, nor does it play any audio. \nMultiple people updated their client mid-stream, so we can pinpoint the issue to the VRChat update, since the same stream worked before the update.\nSeems like the update broke the autoplay functionality for when the world is loaded.",
